<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I want to
personally thank you for helping the American Red Cross connect blood donors to
drives in your area. Your support plays an important role in providing the
convenience donors need and the efficiency we need to serve our mission. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thanks to your
help in filling our blood drives as a Blood Booster, more patients receive the
lifesaving blood they need. Your selfless contribution is greatly appreciated! <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&lt;Account
Representative Name&gt;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&lt;Contact
Info&gt; <o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
